                      "content": "Moving. Component “Metronome / moving-pendulum”, 32 × 354, one PNG of rod + hub. Rotates around its pivot (16, 344) = point (160, 408) in the instrument. Swings −25° ↔ +25°, reaching an end on every click (one side-to-side swing per beat), sine ease at the ends. No blur or shadow. Reduced motion: stays at 0°.",
